  {
    "file": "colleen-our-sign-artist-20261008210806-h5f60f.jpg",
    "title": "Colleen our Sign Artist",
    "description": "Meet Colleen — The Artist Behind Our Beer Signs! 🎨🍻\r\n\r\nSince the day Meander opened its doors, Colleen has been the creative talent behind our hand-drawn beer signs. Every time we come up with a new beer, we can't wait to see what she dreams up!\r\n\r\nWith her unique artistic style, playful sense of humor, and endless creativity, Colleen has a special way of giving each beer its own personality. We never quite know what she'll come up with next, but she never disappoints!\r\n\r\nHer artwork has become part of what makes Meander feel like Meander, and we're so grateful she's been part of our journey",
    "credit": "",
    "album": "Employees & helpers",
